ensorder_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_21","text":"What do you think, Mister?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_22","text":"Whose gift do you want?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_23","text":"Neither.","jump":"m_ex_queensorder_05_25"},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_24","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_24","text":"Both.","jump":"m_ex_queensorder_05_33"},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_25","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_26","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_26","text":"There are no new messages for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_27","text":"I'm not satisfied with this outcome.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_28","text":"Me neither.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_29","text":"We don't want you ending up empty-handed, {AccountData.NickName}-kun,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_30","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_31","text":"why don't you just take both of our gifts?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_05_32","text":"It's the best outcome, really.",